0..75 Comment "// The refusals beside `../../model/modules/model-laws.gandr`: a model that"
76..152 Comment "// neither proves nor admits a law of its theory is refused `UnprovenLaw` by"
153..229 Comment "// the law\'s name, at the module, whose attributes state the expectation; an"
230..292 Comment "// admission at a carrier the host does not provide is refused"
293..367 Comment "// `UnprovenLaw.Admitted` at the admission, the law the author\'s to prove."
368..445 Comment "// Float equality is symmetric and transitive but not reflexive, NaN equal to"
446..522 Comment "// nothing: a model of `Eq` at `f64` admits `sym`, and its `refl` is refused"
523..599 Comment "// whether admitted or left out, so floats are a model of `PartialEq` alone."
601..644 Comment "/// Reflexivity and symmetry of a decision."
